  "details": "Basically what the title says; I’d like the ability to select your favorite friends as additional categories to online and offline friends in the friends tab of the mobile menu interface. The friends tab in the in-game vrchat menu does allow you to select favorite friends as a category, so I’d like to see this parity in the initial mobile menu also. This is also especially useful for (iOS) devices which can download the app but are unable to launch into the game proper.",
